From 00d53f0834bef63220cc6ea66c26b3aecf755cb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 10:48:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(movement): synchronize glide rockets with auth input

Bedrock protocol 2193 embeds item use in PlayerAuthInput without the normal inventory transaction type field. Encode that packed form for flight rockets so the server processes the use on the movement tick. Apply the corrected Bedrock velocity to Java while gliding so correction packets do not preserve stale local motion.
